Other files which are needed for this example are the same as in the
"Eirene_bench_difft_physics" run: eirene*.out, geometry_*.inp, 
ue_rect_slab.geom, uedata_rect_slab.u. Note that ratecalc must be used to
generate the netCDF files for hchexold (hchex.nc).  In hchex.nc, the
value of sgvmax is left at its default value of 0.0 to effectively disable
rejection, as is done in the EIRENE run. The file hionize.nc required
manually alterations following generation by ratecalc in order for it to
work as required. Hence, the binary file is included here.
It should be regenerated if the format (xsection.hweb) of the data changes.
Before compiling readgeometry and readbackground, the flag 
UEDGE_RECT_SLAB must be changed from "0" to "1". A reduced set of tallies, 
obtained by changing the flag OPTIMIZE from "0" to "1" in tallysetup, is 
used for these output data. 80000 flights were run.